  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fc530482c6d2893c9756fbb3a530671d, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  circle: {fileID: 2607}
  loadingText: {fileID: 2608}
  tipText: {fileID: 2584}
  tips:
  - Be carful what direction you expand in.
  - Bleeding enemies cannot recover health.
  - Burning enemies cannot repair their armor.
  - Poisoned enemies cannot regenerate their shield.
  - Enemies drop an extra gold piece for each type of tower which has hit them.
  - Don't use only one type of tower, they get more expensive.
  - Fortified enemies receive -5 base damage from attacks.
  - Elevation gives towers a bonus to their base damage and range.
  - The yellow bar is an enemy's armor.
  - The blue bar is an enemy's shield.
  - Frost towers and Encampments get an RPM bonus based on how much path they cover.
  - Don't forget to set tower priorities.
